# French lexicon, adv, letter e (clean-room, own knowledge)
enfin          adv
ensemble       adv
ensuite        adv
entre-temps    adv rect=entretemps
exprès         adv note=on purpose (faire exprès); the adjective exprès/expresse is a separate entry
extra-muros    adv rect=extramuros conf=90 note=1990 welding of Latin compounds
